    "text": "Hey Jish,\nSee what's possible with SysAid - join our upcoming live sessions and walk away with real insights you can \nuse.\n\n\n\n\n\nWhen AI takes over ITSM\nThere's a lot of noise around AI in IT. This session cuts through it - a live walkthrough of SysAid's AI handling triage, routing, and approvals, so you can see what it does and decide if it's right for your team.\nEvery Wednesday | 10:00 AM EDT\n<https://email.sysaid.com/dc/d4UYuX-eMryeJY2gCUhcl7ZahS_YltLzza1lEvqMcW5jzrJ8uTElK3TADSPaw_G7QvGH75thc6p3I2PvHHiz6Cl57CdUar_hur-BCfFxqN3Iwsk7gs0CtQJUNdGqP2kiH7emEhRaSTYZXTiHlYCY-OgmZTqZTrR4NMJ3e2Q2NnH_Uolv769BUjk4lCLCx_YrM_ijLkehwjp-4bJTYGvUUIcWAqASOaeyj1y0Sr6bKNegKC5EM-_CLq_965LZxSluDcn5vjsGDzqQRLB5-BFefHMJwPeDp9yPUVNfnNSt-PR6TMVNwVfdHlQAzkqLLevzqmhwwvuhcC4cU0RPGNHJEoxO-by_TAMjj6uYa7FCkb1GFJ3zNBTba31K8uyUFdoL06USjeV6tfLpERhBnNXfn97CPRSYsLJ-3gtf_Rs8OoU=/NjEyLUxCQy01OTQAAAGh7yzg2buSXNpnVCY9W-aFDVIeYYYx2HfZ1wW5SN0S7aUSv3cnqgmjKYq_uW_5Y6pf6xhMWtk=>\nDemo hour\n\nMost IT teams aren't lacking tools. They're stuck in workflows that drain time and make every change feel like a project. This session shows you a faster path forward.\n\nReal demo. Real insights. No sales pitch\n\nEvery Wednesday | 12:00 PM EDT\nBest,\nSysAid Team\n80 Atlantic Ave, Suite 501, Toronto, ON M6K 1X9, Canada    Unsubscribe <[[https://info.sysaid.com/UnsubscribePage.html?mkt_unsubscribe=1&mkt_tok=NjEyLUxCQy01OTQAAAGh7yzg2awRv74ZK2wv7kLh4vKv4e_y8KTrHxKtkZoqkFG-mhLaSzSL5JiLWtSFdKljUzRy6pKzyM8FN_9mv7EAJN-wvUTxYj1lZNrQzjvp9phD]]> | Privacy Policy <https://email.sysaid.com/NjEyLUxCQy01OTQAAAGh7yzg2eZbbyhe4M3OCc3T2PkJ32mzrGWRzr-W8efQdX5DG5cXb_YjRZBUnPAwUYG0MM2Qe1k=>\n",
